    "https://jobs.careers.gov.sg/jobs/hrp/17842875/005056a3-53e2-1fd1-a7ff-2822a3711405": {
      "title": "Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Data & AI)",
      "description": "Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Data & AI) | Careers@Gov Expand masthead to find out how to identify an official government website A Singapore Government Agency Website How to identify Official website links end with .gov.sg Government agencies communicate via .gov.sg websites (e.g. go.gov.sg/open). Trusted websites Secure websites use HTTPS Look for a lock ( ) or https:// as an added precaution. Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites. All Open Positions / Singapore Polytechnic Singapore Polytechnic Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Data & AI) Fixed Terms Closing on 23 Sep 2026 Apply Save What the role is Plaque of Commendation (Gold) – NTUC May Day Awards 2026 Most Positive Workplace Collaboration Award – Singapore International Chamber of Commerce (SICC) Awards 2025 The Straits Times Singapore’s Best Employers for 2024, 2025 & 2026 The job of an academic is challenging and meaningful. Not only will he/she has both the knowledge and working experience, he/she must also possess the ability to deconstruct the knowledge and experience, guiding students to reconstruct them as their own knowledge. He/she must also possess a passion for working with youths, nurturing them, and moulding their characters. There will be opportunities to develop the curriculum, introduce new courses as well as be involved in consultancy and other applied research projects. Administrative work related to teaching and School/Institutional strategic initiatives will be an important part of the job too.  Successful candidates will be expected to be resourceful and innovative with initiative and good communication skills. What you will be working on Data & AI / AI Engineering The appointee must be competent to teach in at least three of the following subjects: Python Programming for Data Analytics Full-stack Web Development Data Engineering Big Data Technologies AI & Machine Learning Deep Learning Agile Methodologies and MLOps Graph Database & Analytics Generative AI and Large Language Models Responsibilities:- Conduct lessons, create teaching and assessment materials, and facilitate learning of students (youths and adult learners) Develop and maintain new/existing teaching curriculum. This includes regular review of existing curriculum and make recommendations on areas of improvements that would enhance students’ learning, performance and employability. Keep current and abreast of trends and developments of AI / Machine Learning engineering deployment such as ML & Data Ops, Severless ML Deployment Support the School’ strategic initiatives through involvement in committee work and projects such as research and consultancy projects, development and management of new courses What we are looking for Requirements:- Minimum 2 years of relevant work experience in AI engineering, application development, data engineering or AI/ML ops engineering Proficient in Python programming languages Familiar with: ML Lifecycle Model Versioning, DVC tools CI/CD for ML Added advantage if applicant has experience in: Full-Stack Web Development Software Engineering Containerisation and Orchestration implementation Serverless ML Deployments (Cloud) Model Security Passionate about education and possess strong interest in teaching and mentoring both youths and adult learners. Self-driven, independent and possess readiness to work as a team. Successful candidate will be offered a 2-year contract in the first instance. If you are shortlisted for the position(s), you should hear from us within 30 days of the closing date of the advertisement. Apply Save About your application process This job is closing on 23 Sep 2026. If you do not hear from us within 4 weeks of the job ad closing date, we seek your understanding that it is likely that we are not moving forward with your application for this role. We thank you for your interest and would like to assure you that this does not affect your other job applications with the Public Service. We encourage you to explore and apply for other roles within Singapore Polytechnic or the wider Public Service. About Singapore Polytechnic As Singapore’s first polytechnic, Singapore Polytechnic (SP) prides ourselves in providing the best learning experience for our students in pre-employment and continuing adult education. The mission of SP is to prepare our learners to be life ready, work ready and world ready. Our vision is to be a caring community of inspired learners committed to serving with mastery. Learn more about Singapore Polytechnic Careers@Gov Singapore Get support Contact us Report vulnerability Terms of use Privacy policy Built by © 2026 Open Government Products"
